WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:07.760
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain a Mystery Drama film called “Love&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:19.760
Stoppage Time”. Watch out and take care!
Takashi Aiba is a student working hard to get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:25.840
into a medical university. He is in one of his&nbsp;
classes when suddenly at quarter past twelve,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:31.120
everything around him stops moving. His&nbsp;
classmates remain frozen in their seats and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:37.200
so does his teacher. Takashi cannot believe his&nbsp;
eyes, he looks around confused and starts to laugh&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:45.680
believing he is being pranked. He walks to the&nbsp;
front of the class unsettled by the silence.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:51.840
When he walks outside and sees the entire school&nbsp;
is frozen, he realizes it is not a prank. Somehow,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:57.520
time has stopped for everyone, except for him.&nbsp;
Takashi gets on his bicycle and rides to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:03.120
nearby park. As he travels further, he registers&nbsp;
he might be the only person who can move.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:08.400
He stops after seeing droplets of water frozen&nbsp;
in a water fountain. When he tries to touch it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:13.680
the water falls all over him. From the other side&nbsp;
of the pond, a girl laughs at him, revealing that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:19.600
she can also move. Takashi is about to call&nbsp;
her but he suddenly gets back to the class,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:26.240
where he was before time froze. He is completely&nbsp;
dry as if he had never gotten in the pond. Takashi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:31.280
is shocked at the experience but cannot tell&nbsp;
anyone because no one would believe him. 
&nbsp;

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:36.400
That night, he returns home still thinking&nbsp;
of the strange events of the day. He asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:42.240
his father about his day but doesn’t get any&nbsp;
answers. Takashi’s father is disappointed in him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:47.440
because he was unsuccessful in getting into&nbsp;
his desired university. The following day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:54.320
at 12:15 pm, he is in the library. He bumps into&nbsp;
a guy and sees that the book he dropped has frozen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.320 --> 00:02:00.400
mid-air. Realizing that it is happening again, he&nbsp;
runs to the park to meet the girl from yesterday.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:05.200
When he doesn’t find her there, he goes to&nbsp;
her school that he recognizes by the uniform&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:10.720
she was wearing. After looking for some minutes,&nbsp;
he finds her lying down in the school’s garden.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:19.840
He wakes her up but the girl thinks he is a&nbsp;
pervert. Takashi apologizes and claims that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:24.800
he looked for her because he felt alone. After&nbsp;
finding out they are the only ones who can move,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:30.400
she agrees to accompany him. The pair talks about&nbsp;
the time stopping but has no clue what is causing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:35.680
it and why they are the only ones who can move.&nbsp;
All of a sudden, the girl notices a driver has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:40.720
fallen asleep and is about to drive into some&nbsp;
children crossing the road. She tries to wake&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:46.640
him up to no avail. Takashi knows no matter what&nbsp;
they do to stop him, things will go back to how&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:51.840
they were after the time is reset. Hence,&nbsp;
he looks for the driver's number in the car&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:57.120
and remembers it. As soon as the time resets,&nbsp;
he calls him, hoping to wake the man up. 
&nbsp;

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:02.720
Following that, he runs to the location and sees&nbsp;
that the children are safe. The girl also arrives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:08.400
there and praises his quick thinking. They promise&nbsp;
to meet again tomorrow. Before leaving, the girl&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:14.400
tells him that her name is Tokine Shinomiya.&nbsp;
The next day, they meet at the park again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:20.000
Shinomiya is drawing a sketch which Takashi thinks&nbsp;
is useless because it will disappear when time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:26.560
resets. Still, Shinomiya believes that the picture&nbsp;
will be embedded in her mind so it doesn’t matter.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:32.080
The two then go on a bike ride through the city&nbsp;
and end up in a field. As they talk, they name the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:38.320
pausing of the time “loss time”. Takashi wants&nbsp;
to spend more time with her but is too shy to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:44.080
ask her out. Shinomiya senses this and says that&nbsp;
they should meet the next day and go on a date.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:50.400
Later that day, Takashi is cooking while singing,&nbsp;
clearly in a good mood. However, it changes when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:56.400
he notices his father Seiji behind him. As they&nbsp;
talk, we find out that Takashi’s mother died of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:02.000
an illness when he was nine but Seiji didn’t come&nbsp;
to visit her in the hospital. Ever since then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:07.360
their relationship hasn’t been the same. 
The next day, Shinomiya and Takashi meet at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:11.840
park for their date. She claims that she wants to&nbsp;
play on the trampoline because she is embarrassed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:16.960
to do it when people are watching. Takashi&nbsp;
watches her play like a child and cannot help&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:23.200
but smile. Following that, he lays out the food he&nbsp;
has cooked for her. At first, Shinomiya hesitates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:28.320
to eat it saying that she is on a diet. Takashi&nbsp;
reminds her that after the loss time is over,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:33.120
she will go back to being hungry so she can eat&nbsp;
as much as she wants. The two enjoy the food&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:38.160
together while talking about different things.&nbsp;
Eventually, they get into an argument when Takashi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:43.840
says he is giving up on his dreams. Shinomiya&nbsp;
calls him lazy, making him walk away from her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:49.200
He accidentally pushes her to the ground when&nbsp;
suddenly, the time restarts. Somewhere else in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:54.960
a hospital, doctor Asami walks into a room to&nbsp;
his sick wife. She has been sick for several&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.960 --> 00:05:00.960
years and the chances of her getting well are&nbsp;
low. Like Shinomiya, she also loves to sketch.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:05.920
Asami takes care of her dearly but she feels&nbsp;
like she is a burden to him. The following day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:11.760
Takashi is in his room reading manga when the&nbsp;
time stops again. He runs to the park and sees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:17.360
Shinomiya waiting for him. Both of them apologize&nbsp;
to each other and reconcile. They decide to meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:22.560
at his home the following day. Takashi tells&nbsp;
her that his goal in life is to be a doctor. 
&nbsp;

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:27.600
They go for a bicycle ride and end up in the&nbsp;
same field again. Takashi moves forward to kiss&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:33.920
her but the time resets just then, and he ends up&nbsp;
back in his room. In the meantime, Asami and his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:39.440
wife’s relationship takes a turn when she says she&nbsp;
doesn’t want to be with him anymore. He is shocked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:45.360
and asks her why, even though he knows the reason.&nbsp;
She tells him that she is being transferred to a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:50.720
hospice health care place tomorrow and wants to&nbsp;
live however she wants for the time she has left.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:56.560
Asami tries to reason with her but she dismisses&nbsp;
him. The next day, Shinomiya knocks on Takashi’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.560 --> 00:06:01.920
door for their date. She is wearing a beautiful&nbsp;
dress that leaves him speechless. He welcomes her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:07.520
in and compliments her, making Shinomiya blush. He&nbsp;
has prepared several dishes for them that excite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:12.640
her. Before sitting down to eat, he gives her a&nbsp;
pair of fancy chopsticks as a gift. The two enjoy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:19.760
the food in silence. Later, Takashi asks Shinomiya&nbsp;
what she plans to be in the future. She seems to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:24.960
avoid the question and talks about a time capsule&nbsp;
that she buried when she was little. The capsule&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:30.480
contained papers where she had written her dreams&nbsp;
and aspirations but she doesn’t remember them now.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:35.840
Takashi suggests they dig it up but it turns out&nbsp;
that the field is someone’s front yard now. 
&nbsp;

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:40.240
After the meal, they enjoy a chocolate cake&nbsp;
together. Takashi invites her to a firework&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:46.320
display at night but she claims that she cannot&nbsp;
see him anymore. A shocked Takashi asks her why&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:51.920
but the time resets and he never gets to know the&nbsp;
answer. The following day when time freezes again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:58.320
he looks for her all around but doesn’t find her.&nbsp;
Later, he asks her classmates who inform him that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:02.960
she is in the hospital getting treated&nbsp;
for a deadly disease. Takashi quickly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:07.200
runs to the hospital and finds out that she&nbsp;
has a condition called Wilson's disease.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:12.560
The chances of her survival are low because only&nbsp;
a liver transplant can save her. All of her family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:18.080
have gotten tested but none of their liver is a&nbsp;
match to her. Moreover, to perform the transplant,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:23.600
the donor has to be a family member, so she has&nbsp;
lost the hope for survival. She also reveals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:28.880
that the day she found out that she won’t get a&nbsp;
donor is also the day the loss time started. 
&nbsp;

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:34.000
Takashi insists he will take a test to see if&nbsp;
his liver matches her but Shinomiya thinks it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:39.840
is fruitless. When he doesn’t back up, she tells&nbsp;
him she has only six months to live, so doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:45.600
want to see him anymore. At home, Takashi googles&nbsp;
Wilson's disease and reads several articles about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:50.560
it. He finds out that a person suffering from the&nbsp;
disease isn’t allowed to eat chocolate, shrimp,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:56.080
and seaweed, everything that he had been feeding&nbsp;
her till now. Shinomiya was able to enjoy the food&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.080 --> 00:08:01.360
she liked when she was with him. After finding&nbsp;
this out, he rushes to the hospital again. 
&nbsp;

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:07.680
He walks into Doctor Asami and asks him to save&nbsp;
her at any cost. To his surprise, the doctor asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:12.720
him if time stops for them as well. They go to&nbsp;
the rooftop to talk about the matter. It is then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:18.480
revealed that Asami and his wife also went through&nbsp;
the same experience as Takashi and Shinomiya did.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:22.800
Asami’s wife was suffering from a terminal&nbsp;
disease that needed a liver transplant.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:28.480
Suddenly, the two started to experience loss time&nbsp;
and met each other. It was almost like god's way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:33.440
of telling them that their liver matched and Asami&nbsp;
could help her survive. Since both pairs’ story is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:39.600
very similar, he believes that Takashi’s liver&nbsp;
will also be a match to Shinomiya. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:44.960
for a living transplant, there are several rules&nbsp;
that need to be followed. First of all, the donor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:50.640
must be the recipient’s relative. This can be&nbsp;
managed if the two get married. But still, Takashi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:56.240
cannot donate organs before the age of twenty. 
Their last chance would be to hope that Shinomiya&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.240 --> 00:09:01.520
survives for one more year until he can legally&nbsp;
donate his liver. But the doctor claims that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:06.800
can hardly survive for six months at the rate her&nbsp;
health is currently deteriorating. Following the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:12.160
interaction with Asami, Takashi sits beside&nbsp;
Shinomiya, looking through her sketchbook.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:16.000
All of her sketches are of the memories&nbsp;
they made together; like the water fountain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:20.320
where they first saw each other and the&nbsp;
lunch box that he made for her. But what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:28.080
catches his attention is a sketch of himself. 
When Takashi returns home at night, he asks his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:33.360
father Seiji how his mother was able to survive&nbsp;
for more time than the doctors had predicted.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:38.480
He is informed that she used to say she won’t die&nbsp;
before Seiji fulfilled his dream to construct a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:44.160
bridge. She held on for a few months but sadly&nbsp;
couldn’t see the finished product. During her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:49.040
death, Seiji was at the construction site trying&nbsp;
to complete it quickly because it was the only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:54.960
thing he could do for her. Hearing this, Takashi&nbsp;
forgives his father for not being there when she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.960 --> 00:10:00.480
passed away. The next day when time freezes, he&nbsp;
goes to the house where Shinomiya had buried her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:06.080
time capsule. He has made it his mission to find&nbsp;
the box no matter what. He digs different areas&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:12.160
of the yard each day and keeps track using a map.&nbsp;
After digging for several days, he finally finds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:16.960
the box and runs to the hospital to give it to&nbsp;
her. Shinomiya says he shouldn’t have worked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:21.920
that hard but she is secretly delighted to have&nbsp;
the box back. On looking through it, she finds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:27.520
drawings of her as a baker, a florist, and so&nbsp;
on. Takashi also shows her the sheet that says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:34.160
his liver matches to her which means they met for&nbsp;
a reason. To her surprise, he kneels down and asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:40.720
her to marry him. Shinomiya cries, overwhelmed by&nbsp;
the gesture but Takashi promises to save her.
&nbsp;

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:45.280
Asami has talked to the ethics community of the&nbsp;
hospital who allow Takashi to donate under the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:50.720
consent of his parents. He asks permission from&nbsp;
his father, urging him to sign the consent papers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:55.680
He claims that only forty percent of his liver&nbsp;
will be used, so he will only suffer from mild&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:55.680 --> 00:11:01.760
discomfort. But if it means saving Shinomiya’s&nbsp;
life, he is willing to do anything. Still, Seiji&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:07.040
doesn’t permit him to make the reckless decision.&nbsp;
The following day is the day Takashi and Shinomiya&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:12.240
get married. The hospital is being decorated&nbsp;
for the ceremony. Takashi puts two watches on a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:17.600
platform as a replacement for their wedding rings.&nbsp;
Asami comments that he feels like he is going back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:23.200
in time because his wedding was also very similar.&nbsp;
To Takashi’s surprise, his father arrives at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:28.400
hospital with signed papers, happy that his&nbsp;
son has made a decision to save someone’s life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:35.040
However, the story takes a turn when Takashi finds&nbsp;
Shinomiya unconscious in her hospital room. 
&nbsp;

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:40.480
She is taken to the ICU immediately but the&nbsp;
doctors can do nothing as she goes into a coma.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:46.080
Takashi finds a letter addressed to him where&nbsp;
Shinomiya thanks him for making her life better.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:51.360
She also expresses her love for him for the first&nbsp;
time in the letter. When the clock hits 12:15,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:57.360
the time doesn’t pause. Takashi believes&nbsp;
that this means Shinomiya has passed away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:57.360 --> 00:12:03.200
but the doctor informs him that there is still a&nbsp;
chance. Cut to a few weeks later. Takashi wakes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:09.520
up on a hospital bed next to Shinomiya after the&nbsp;
organ transplant. They both are alive and well.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:14.640
The couple holds hands, thankful for their health.&nbsp;
Somewhere else, Asami and his wife are watching&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:20.400
the sea. Asami makes her understand that she is&nbsp;
not a burden on him, in fact, she makes his life&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:26.000
better. The two reconcile and he assures her he&nbsp;
will find a way for them to be together again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:31.280
In the last scene, we see Takashi and&nbsp;
Shinomiya having lunch at the park on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:35.920
Shinomiya’s seventeenth birthday. 
